WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.768
Hi, I'm Bruno. I help school support staff with behavior support.

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:11.568
We practice staying calm, de-escalation steps, and simple routines that prevent hard moments.

00:00:11.768 --> 00:00:15.680
For example, ask me: a student is escalating. What do I do first?
